<title>SWEDEN: EMU no will not hit Sweden inflation much-Riksbank.</title>
<headline>EMU no will not hit Sweden inflation much-Riksbank.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The deputy governor of Sweden's central bank, Lars Heikensten, on Tuesday said that inflation would not be affected significantly if Sweden said no to joining Europe's Economic and Monetary Union (EMU).</p>
</text>
